!!! oculus/scene-smoke.mat
!!! Smoke test for the semantic scene model.
!!!
!!! Exercises: creating a scene node, checking geometry, checking focus.

book oculus.scene.smoke

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from oculus.window.geometry
read everything from oculus.window.role
read everything from oculus.window.focus
read everything from oculus.scene.node

main returns number begin paragraph
    !!! Build a root desktop node.
    value origin is build point with x being 0, y being 0
    value root-geom is build rectangle with origin being origin, width being 1024, height being 768
    
    value root is build scene-node with identity being 1, role being window-role.Desktop, geometry being root-geom, focus being focus-position.Focused, label being "desktop", parent-identity being 0

    !!! Verify the geometry.
    when root.geometry.width is at least 1024 then
        say "root width is correct"
    otherwise
        say "root width failed"
    end when
    
    when root.geometry.height is at least 768 then
        say "root height is correct"
    otherwise
        say "root height failed"
    end when
    
    !!! Verify the role.
    say "root identity is 1"
    
    give 0
end paragraph
